pporting small businesses, and giving people like you and me another reason to get out of the house and enjoy life.</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.65;">Thank you for being part of this journey with me. 🫶🏼</p><p style="margin: 6px 0 0; font: 650 30px/1.15 var(--font-hand); color: var(--tomato);">Love,<br/>Tina</p></div></div><div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 240px), 1fr)); gap: 30px;"><figure style="margin: 0; border-radius: 18px; overflow: hidden; aspect-ratio: 3 / 4; box-shadow: 0 0 0 8px var(--vinyl), var(--lift); transform: rotate(-1.5deg); background: var(--butter);"><img alt="Tina taking a big bite of a sushi roll with chopsticks, holding up the platter" decoding="async" height="1600" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 720px) 92vw, 380px" src="<?php echo ltef_theme_img( 'tina/tina-sushi-1200.webp' ); ?>" srcset="<?php echo ltef_theme_img( 'tina/tina-sushi-600.webp' ); ?> 600w, <?php echo ltef_theme_img( 'tina/tina-sushi-1200.webp' ); ?> 1200w" style="display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;" width="1200"/></figure><figure style="margin: 0; border-radius: 18px; overflow: hidden; aspect-ratio: 3 / 4; box-shadow: 0 0 0 8px var(--vinyl), var(--lift); transform: rotate(1.2deg); background: var(--butter);"><img alt="Tina holding two drinks out to the camera, one pink and fizzy, one caramel with a heart marshmallow" decoding="async" height="1600" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 720px) 92vw, 380px" src="<?php echo ltef_theme_img( 'tina/tina-cheers-1200.webp' ); ?>" srcset="<?php echo ltef_theme_img( 'tina/tina-cheers-600.webp' ); ?> 600w, <?php echo ltef_theme_img( 'tina/tina-cheers-1200.webp' ); ?> 1200w" style="display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;" width="1200"/></figure><figure style="margin: 0; border-radius: 18px; overflow: hidden; aspect-ratio: 3 / 4; box-shadow: 0 0 0 8px var(--vinyl), var(--lift); transform: rotat